# Dwynen, Gilt-Leaf Daen: "Whenever Dwynen attacks, you gain 1 life for each attacking Elf you control" (CR 508.1, 608.2h) and "Other Elf creatures you
# control get +1/+1" (CR 613.4c). Turn 3: Dwynen attacks alone and gains 1 (herself counted). Turn 5: Dwynen, Elvish Mystic and Memnite attack, Dwynen's
# Elite and its Elf Warrior token stay home, so only Dwynen and the Mystic count (2 life). The Mystic is 2/2, the Elite 3/3 and the token 2/2, while
# Dwynen is still 3/4, Memnite is not an Elf and Bot2's own Elvish Mystic is not helped.

